{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2026-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1781568000, "end_date": 1782172799, "month_true_total": 201, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:56:31 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "228603129", "author": {"steamid": "76561199670539910", "personaname": "danny", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199670539910/", "num_games_owned": 180, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 1112, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 717, "last_played": 1782491745, "avatar": "626bbb7465867eefb8c7c536c5b332fb9ca47af9"}, "language": "english", "review": "gunfire reborn is what happens when borderlands, a roguelike, and pure chaos have a baby. 10/10, would get one-shot by a random enemy again.", "timestamp_created": 1782168865, "timestamp_updated": 1782168865, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.520547926425933838", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 32, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "228583367", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071180332", "personaname": "Vulpes With Ink", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/VulpesVulpesVulpes/", "num_games_owned": 292, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 7598, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7521, "last_played": 1784751974, "avatar": "958160f582e3ea3bf094b1980ac33d3219f47cf9"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really like the game but the Pink Rabbit is like if a bustier Lola Bunny decided to get some manga-esk flowers curse, with a manwa-esk sword which she never actually swing with, while also being weirdly sexual about it.\n\nWhich is bizzare cuz the later female characters range from cute to cool, so it kinda sticks out.", "timestamp_created": 1782149516, "timestamp_updated": 1782149516, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.446729958057403564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228582801", "author": {"steamid": "76561198397402885", "personaname": "ExquisiteMantle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198397402885/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1468, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 872, "last_played": 1784144988, "avatar": "aa7813d848bffa26c9dfc48e3f073dc9808560c0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Got told to get this game by my cousin who mashed it and said we should play together its very fun. He was right. borderlands 2 esque gunplay with roguelike dungeon crawling. simple yet pretty graphics and a core gameplay loop that is fun and rewarding. Some of the features take a little getting used to like the runes and modifiers for harder difficulties but they are no means a roadblock for progression if you just say screw it and choose stuff at random and figure it out as you go! \n\nVery easy to loose time to or just as a one or two dungeon run every once in a while. Reasonably priced for the content and replayability you get. The DLC characters are particularly strong though I will admit, not that there's anything wrong with that just be aware of you want to wreck shop then those characters have some serious exponential potential. 100% better with friends too! I just wish the cross play was true cross play and let consoles mix as some of my friends want to play but only if we all can and we don't all have the same systems.", "timestamp_created": 1782148987, "timestamp_updated": 1782148987, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "hardware": {"system_ram": "16215", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10750H CPU @ 2.60GHz", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060", "vram_size": 5955}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228580304", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048748184", "personaname": "Malakore", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198048748184/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 1698, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1038, "last_played": 1782868197, "avatar": "95d8f1c00bbdc43e289e494f3dad027a6f930ac4"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is a lot of fun. Don't get discouraged if you die early on. You'll keep increasing your power over time and things that caused you problems won't be an issue. One thing I think that needs to be improved is the dodge distance because it rarely gets you out of harms way. Anyhow if you can get this on sale you'll get your money's worth for sure.", "timestamp_created": 1782146641, "timestamp_updated": 1782146641, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228565653", "author": {"steamid": "76561198272505259", "personaname": "glorbo florbo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/amogussussus/", "num_games_owned": 200, "num_reviews": 101, "playtime_forever": 9640, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 440, "last_played": 1785079564, "avatar": "db02d190b9740187f2b5a84cff05379f31425d0b"}, "language": "english", "review": "neato", "timestamp_created": 1782133113, "timestamp_updated": 1782133113, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}